<title>GREECE: Greek Nov inflation below 8.0 pct - govt source.</title>
<headline>Greek Nov inflation below 8.0 pct - govt source.</headline>
<dateline>ATHENS 1996-12-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Greece's consumer price inflation was below 8.0 percent year-on-year in November, and possibly below 7.9 percent, after 8.3 percent in October, a government source said.</p>
<p>&quot;Inflation is definitely below 8.0 percent in November and might not even stop at 7.9 percent,&quot; the source said.</p>
<p>Press reports have said CPI inflation would be between 7.9 and 8.0 percent in November.</p>
<p>--Dimitris Kontogiannis, Athens Newsroom +301 3311812-4</p>
